[WORK]
UID: WORK-MODEL-AND-HUMAN-REPRESENTATIONS
TITLE: Representations for a model's entry points and for generated human documents
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
More representations over the canon, beyond the page a person reads: entry
points a model reads -- the steering and instruction files each agent loads,
rendered from the canon in place of the hand-kept ones -- and content a
person reads outside the page: generated READMEs, markdown documents, docs.
Each is a narrative or a new representation type (DEC-INLINE-CODE-TYPE is
open) drawn by the same programs, so it goes dirty when what it presents
changes.
<<<
